Troubleshooting Tips
Permission Denied Errors:

Check file permissions with ls -l
Ensure scripts have execute permission: chmod +x script.sh
Verify you're in the correct directory: pwd
Command Not Found:

Verify the command is installed: which command_name
Check your PATH: echo $PATH
For tree command: sudo apt-get install tree (if needed)
Grep/Awk/Sed Not Working as Expected:

Check delimiter in awk: -F',' for CSV files
Verify regex patterns are properly quoted
Use -n with sed when using p command
Test patterns on small samples first
File Not Found:

Use absolute paths or verify current directory
Check file names for typos: ls -la
Verify file was created: test -f filename && echo "exists"
Pipeline Errors:

Test each command separately before piping
Check for proper quoting in complex commands
Verify input/output redirections don't conflict
